cross join (values
    ('Painted Electrical Box', 'Look for metal utility boxes on street corners or sidewalks that have been fully painted with bright colors or designs—snap it straight-on to capture the entire artwork.', 'Show an electrical utility box with a painted mural or artwork covering its exterior surface. The paint must clearly cover the box face.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Utility box art programs reduce reported graffiti in neighborhoods by up to 40% through authorized legal outlets.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/88d3fa350f5fbd60.jpg', 0),
    ('Sticker Collage on Utility Cabinet', 'Find gray or metal utility cabinets covered in layers of stickers from different artists and get close enough to show the overlapping details and variety of designs.', 'Show a utility cabinet covered with multiple overlapping stickers, patches, or decals. The stickers must be visibly layered and cover significant area.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Sticker bombing emerged from 1980s punk zine culture and became a distinct street art form separate from traditional graffiti.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/b3e25241ac8316d1.jpg', 1),
    ('Wheatpaste Mural on Infrastructure', 'Search for large pasted paper artworks on walls, pillars, or structural supports—photograph from a distance to show the full image and any weathering at the edges.', 'Show a large pasted paper artwork (wheatpaste style) applied to street infrastructure like poles, boxes, or walls. The pasted image must be clearly visible.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Wheatpaste adhesive is flour-based, making it less permanent than spray paint but easier to remove without damaging surfaces.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/48f39941b1ed4303.jpg', 2),
    ('Handpainted Utility Box Door', 'Hunt for utility box doors with painted artwork that looks hand-brushed or clearly not spray-painted, and capture it from directly in front to show the brush strokes.', 'Show a utility box door with hand-painted artwork or designs. The door must be clearly identifiable as part of a utility structure and feature visible brushwork.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Hand-painted street art commands higher insurance values than murals; some pieces have appreciated 300% in urban markets.', null, 3),
    ('Abstract Geometric Design on Power Box', 'Spot power boxes featuring geometric shapes, lines, or patterns rather than representational images, and photograph it at a slight angle to show depth.', 'Show a power box with abstract geometric patterns, shapes, or lines painted on it. The design must feature non-representational geometric forms.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Geometric street art aligns with cognitive psychology: symmetrical patterns are processed faster by human brains than organic ones.', null, 4),
    ('Character Art on Street Cabinet', 'Find street cabinets decorated with cartoon characters, mascots, or illustrated figures—shoot head-on to show facial details and expression clearly.', 'Show a street utility cabinet with a painted or rendered character (figure, face, or stylized form). The character must be clearly visible on the cabinet surface.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Character-based street art originated in Copenhagen''s Nørrebro district and became the foundation of modern cartoon street aesthetics.', null, 5),
    ('Layered Street Art on Utility Housing', 'Look for utility housings where you can see multiple layers of art stacked on top of each other, and photograph close-up to reveal the overlapping details.', 'Show utility housing with multiple overlapping layers of street art, stickers, or paint. You must see distinct layers or overlapping artworks.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Palimpsest street art—layers over time—creates archaeological records visible only to long-term neighborhood residents.', null, 6),
    ('Monochrome Spray Paint on Box', 'Search for utility boxes with single-color spray paint designs or black and white artwork, and position yourself to capture crisp lines and shading.', 'Show a utility box with single-color spray paint artwork or tagging. The spray paint must be clearly visible on the box exterior.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Single-color spray work requires more technical skill than multicolor pieces; called ''bombing'' in traditional graffiti terminology.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/f7413c376a684e7c.jpg', 7),
    ('Colorful Utility Box Mural', 'Find utility boxes covered in bright, multi-colored designs and photograph it in good daylight so the colors pop and stand out clearly.', 'Show a utility box with a multi-colored mural or artwork. The design must use multiple vibrant colors across the box face.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'San Francisco''s Clarion Alley murals increased nearby property values by 3-5% according to neighborhood economic studies.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/57a11e284b665058.jpg', 8),
    ('Tagged Infrastructure Post', 'Look for metal posts or poles with spray-painted tags and signatures, and shoot vertically to capture the full height of the piece.', 'Show a street post, pole, or infrastructure element with visible tags, names, or graffiti markings. The tags must be clearly readable or visible.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Tags evolved as gang identification systems before becoming an independent artistic form with distinct letterforms and styles.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/cbe54a2f2d1c7046.png', 9),
    ('Detailed Portrait on Electrical Cabinet', 'Hunt for electrical cabinets featuring realistic or detailed faces and portraits—get centered and close enough to see facial features and shading.', 'Show an electrical cabinet with a detailed portrait or face artwork. The portrait must be clear enough to distinguish facial features.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Portrait murals require specialized skills; top street artists charge $5,000+ per meter for photorealistic utility box commissions.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/2a76e887bbbc4154.jpg', 10),
    ('Mixed Media Art on Utility Structure', 'Find utility structures combining different materials like paint, stickers, markers, and paste—photograph wide enough to show the variety of techniques used.', 'Show a utility structure with artwork combining multiple media types (paint, stickers, paste, materials). At least two different art techniques must be visible.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Mixed media street art on public utilities combines paint, paste, stickers, and found objects in single works.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/579a319147ded3f2.jpg', 11),
    ('Decorative Pattern on Street Box', 'Look for utility boxes with repeating patterns, ornamental designs, or detailed linework—shoot straight-on to emphasize symmetry and precision.', 'Show a street utility box with repeating decorative patterns or ornamental designs. The pattern must cover a significant portion of the box surface.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Repeating pattern designs on utilities echo Islamic geometric principles, reducing visual monotony in urban infrastructure.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/77480a9631168525.jpg', 12),
    ('Graffiti Piece on Public Utility Equipment', 'Spot spray-painted graffiti on utility equipment like transformers or cabinets and photograph it clearly to show style, colors, and any 3D effects.', 'Show public utility equipment (box, cabinet, housing) with a complete graffiti piece, tag, or throw-up. The graffiti must be clearly visible.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'NYC''s 5Pointz warehouse housed 5,000+ tagged pieces; demolition in 2013 was considered cultural erasure by street art community.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/047c2d8acc2f5e69.jpg', 13),
    ('Commissioned Street Art on Utility Installation', 'Find professionally done or official street art on utility boxes or installations that looks planned and polished—shoot in even lighting to show quality.', 'Show a utility installation with professional-quality street art or mural work. The artwork must appear intentional, refined, and cover the installation surface.', 'rare'::public.item_rarity, 'Commissioned utility box art became municipal policy in Portland (OR), Denver, and Austin; generates artist income averaging $2,000-8,000 per piece.', null, 14)
